      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There may be more to this than just Physbones. I tried making a simple non-humanoid avatar (so no colliders) with single Physbone and found it doesn't crash.\n\nThrough some trial and error, I think I narrowed down the issue. ([Avatar Link](https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_42f91472-f786-44c3-b360-41790b9dfd83)) The physbone has some non default values. \n\n- 5 Physbone Colliders\n\n- Immobile World 0.9\n\n- Stretch Motion 0.5\n\n- Max Stretch/Squish 0.5\n\n- Is Animated True",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
