  "details": "Physbone components appear to have an issue with them where if you travel far enough from world origin, your client will eventually crash.\n\nRepro:\n\nGo to this world\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_b9f80349-74af-4840-8ce9-a1b783436590\n\n﻿\n\nFirst use this avatar and go through, observe how you proceed through just fine.\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000\n\n﻿\n\nNow start from the beginning with this avatar, and you should immediately crash when entering the room that is approx. 5mil from origin.\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_f92ca803-08fa-48b3-927a-2a3c5210b74a\n\nI've tested on avatars with and without physbones and only avatars with physbones did I end up crashing.",
